<title>JAPAN: Daito Woolen - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daito Woolen - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.53		vs	   10.76</p>
<p> Operating	  207    million    vs	  181    million</p>
<p> Current	    144    million    vs	   77    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 913    million    vs    loss 76    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 30.46 yen	  vs     loss 2.56 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Daito Woolen Spinning &amp; Weaving Co Ltd is a wool spinner in the Mitsui group.</p>
</text>
